// Shelters and bedding (old ShelterTypeConfig, Gear tents, MaterialProperties and BeddingFeature);
// the camp recipes that make them are in recipes.json. Loaded once by Content;
// ContentTests checks every name in here resolves.
//
// kinds: every ShelterKind: its starting levels, how far work can take them (caps), whether it is
//   found in the world (isNatural) and whether it melts (isSnow), both stated. Levels and caps are 0-1.
// tents: pitched tents by gear kind (items.json); a cap left out is the kind's.
// materials: old item counts become kilos through a nominal piece (pieceKg: a stick, a log, a hide);
//   insulating, waterproof and structural say how much one does for each shelter stat. shelter false
//   is a material recipes use that cannot be worked into a shelter.
// beddings: every BeddingKind. qualityPct is sleep efficiency and keeps you off wet ground;
//   warmthBonusF is felt asleep.
{
